oadEmptyFile:"the file is empty.",uploadCancel:"Cancel",uploadCancelled:"File upload cancelled.",uploadWarnings:"Warnings",uploadViewDetails:"View details",uploadViewFileNames:"View processed filenames",emailUploadPanel:"Ingest new .eml files",tranEmailUploadPanel:"Upload lost-asset email for TranNNB",emailStagingHint:"Emails are processed into cases; Render staging is for synthetic/test data only and may lose data after a redeploy.",tranEmailWaitingForCase:"The email was processed; the LOST case is being synchronized into the form.",tranEmailPrefillReady:"LOST cases from the newly uploaded email were grouped and source-backed fields were prefilled. Review any remaining blanks.",tranEmailNoLostCase:"The email was processed but did not create a LOST case for this form; review the upload warnings.",m365Title:"Microsoft 365 / Outlook connection",m365Description:"Connect the account dedicated to this workspace, choose one exact folder, and ingest new mail into the workflow.",m365Connected:"Connected",m365Disconnected:"Not connected",m365Unavailable:"Microsoft 365 has not been configured for this workspace. Configure Entra ID on the server before connecting.",m365Account:"Outlook account",m365NoAccount:"No account connected",m365Connect:"Connect Outlook",m365Connecting:"Opening Microsoft…",m365Disconnect:"Disconnect",m365Disconnecting:"Disconnecting…",m365RefreshStatus:"Refresh status",m365StatusRefreshed:"The Outlook connection status has been refreshed.",m365DisconnectedNotice:"The Outlook account has been disconnected.",m365FolderSavedNotice:"The allowed Outlook folder has been saved.",m365AuthorizationInvalid:"The server returned an invalid Microsoft sign-in address.",m365Folder:"Mail folder allowed for sync",m365ChooseFolder:"Choose the exact folder",m365NoFolders:"No folders available",m365SaveFolder:"Save folder",m365SavingFolder:"Saving…",m365SyncNow:"Sync new mail",m365Syncing:"Syncing…",m365SelectedFolder:"Selected folder",m365CursorReady:"The next run will read only changes since the latest completed sync.",m365CursorInitial:"The first run considers only mail from the last 30 days and applies the server's safety limits.",m365AutoSync:"Sync automatically every 5 minutes while the dashboard is open",m365SafetyTitle:"Safe scope:",m365Safety:"Only new mail in the exact selected folder is read; messages are never marked read, moved, deleted, or sent.",m365MemoryWarning:"The connection session and sync checkpoint are held only in server memory and are lost on a Render redeploy/restart. Automatic sync runs only while this tab is open and visible; it is not a background job.",m365Loading:"Loading Outlook status…",m365SyncComplete:"Outlook sync completed",m365Fetched:"Messages fetched",m365Ingested:"New cases",m365Cases:"Returned cases",m365HasMore:"More new mail remains beyond this run's safety limit. Select sync again to continue.",companionTitle:"Connect Outlook without Microsoft Graph",companionSubtitle:"Choose either option below. Both use a short-lived one-time pairing code created by the product.",companionHowTitle:"How it works, in very simple words:",companionHowText:"The product gives you a one-use ticket. Enter it in the Add-in or Bridge to connect the two sides.",companionNganHowText:"The product gives you a one-use ticket. The Add-in or Bridge uses it to carry only the mail you choose into NganTLT. Ngan ingests the mail and creates a case; it does not return a reply draft to Outlook.",companionTranHowText:"The product gives you a one-use ticket. The Add-in or Bridge uses it to carry only the mail you choose into TranNNB. After processing, it carries the draft back to that exact original mail.",companionChooseTitle:"Which option should I choose?",companionChooseAddin:"A few messages, the simplest setup, or new/web Outlook → choose the Add-in.",companionChooseBridge:"Many messages, folder scanning, and Classic Outlook on Windows → choose Local Bridge.",companionAddinTitle:"Option 1 — Outlook Add-in",companionAddinBestF